              "heading": "Change Your Seat with CloudWay 24"
            },
            "text": "CloudWay 24 offers a simple and flexible process for changing your seat to suit your comfort and preference. Whether you want extra legroom, prefer a window or aisle seat, or wish to sit closer to the front, you can manage your seat selection seamlessly through our website or mobile app."
